    "multicolumn_VbCeah": {
      "type": "multicolumn",
      "blocks": {
        "column_CRRExP": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Rechargeable_Nail_Fungus_Remover_Test-1.webp",
            "title": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐",
            "text": "<h3>Simple to Use and Truly Effective</h3><p>I'm very pleased with this device that helps treat nail fungus. It's easy to use and actually delivers results. It's a smart investment because it can be used many times. I'm extremely satisfied with my purchase and would definitely recommend it to others.</p><p><strong>Rachel Kram</strong></p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_NzMLLq": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Rechargeable_Nail_Fungus_Remover_Test-2.webp",
            "title": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐",
            "text": "<h3>Nails Look Better Overnight</h3><p>I’m not sure what caused the change in my nails, but they had become very dark after years of using nail polish and filing them down. I tried this product last night, and I’m amazed. One nail is already 50% clearer, and half of another nail is back to its natural color. The dryness is also gone. All of this happened in less than 12 hours! I use it at night, and I’m very pleased with the results.</p><p><strong>Marcus Russom</strong></p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_ndAhdL": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Rechargeable_Nail_Fungus_Remover_Test-3.webp",
            "title": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐",
            "text": "<h3>Comfortable and Rechargeable</h3><p>This device is very comfortable to wear and works really well. Since it's rechargeable, it's super convenient to use in the car or while traveling. I've been using it every day and hope it fully helps with my nail fungus. So far, I'm pleased with the results.</p><p><strong>Naiara Lima</strong></p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "column_CRRExP",
        "column_NzMLLq",
        "column_ndAhdL"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.multicolumn.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "title": "See Why +3,000 Customers Love Nook&Stitch™",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "heading_center": "center",
