    "image_with_text_TRNcKj": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_PdpjCH": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Tired of dealing with thick, yellow, brittle nails?",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_QRLyrQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>If you're tired of dealing with thick, yellow, brittle nails, you're not alone—many people struggle to find a solution that truly works.</p><p>Living with discolored, thickened nails leaves you feeling embarrassed and self-conscious. Without a solution, the fungus spreads, <strong>damaging healthy nails</strong> and forcing costly trips to <strong>clinics or harsh medications</strong>.</p><p>Introducing Nook&Stitch FungeeFree™, your breakthrough <strong>at-home nail fungus treatment</strong>. Using advanced dual-light technology—this device penetrates deep into the nail bed, killing stubborn infections safely.</p>",
            "text_style": "subtitle"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_PdpjCH",
        "text_QRLyrQ"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/487f1194d39e42098793e488fb4a5e30.SD-480p-0.9Mbps-46676407.gif",
        "height": "adapt",
        "desktop_image_width": "medium",
        "layout": "image_first",
        "desktop_content_position": "top",
        "desktop_content_alignment": "left",
        "content_layout": "no-overlap",
