    "image_with_text_6ET6aQ": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_c4KPVc": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Get Fungus-Free Nails in Mins Without the Hassle!",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_Y4M4FL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Most traditional treatments only scratch the surface—<strong>creams struggle to penetrate the nail</strong>, and <strong>pills come with risky side effects</strong>.</p><p>With Nook&Stitch FungeeFree™, <strong>UV and infrared light therapy</strong> specifically targets the nail bed, reaching deep into the source of infection where fungus hides and thrives. This science-backed approach <strong>eliminates recurring nail fungus for good</strong>, without messy applications, prescriptions, or harm to your body.</p>",
            "text_style": "subtitle"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_c4KPVc",
        "text_Y4M4FL"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name",
      "settings": {
