    "image_with_text_6fXEXp": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_T8qc8Q": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How Does It Work?",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_zXNDKA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The Nook&Stitch FungeeFree™ device uses dual-light technology (<strong>460nm blue light and 910nm infrared</strong>) to target nail fungus. The blue light disrupts fungal growth, while the infrared light promotes healing. Each painless, 7-minute session features automatic shutoff.</p><p>For best results, <strong>use twice daily for weeks to months</strong>. Its compact, rechargeable design ensures portability and ease of use, fitting seamlessly into your routine. By treating one nail at a time, it delivers focused therapy without discomfort.</p>",
            "text_style": "subtitle"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_T8qc8Q",
