        "text_hFA3tG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>As a podiatrist, I’ve treated countless cases of dry, cracked heels and stubborn calluses. Many over-the-counter solutions fail, leaving feet rough and uncomfortable.</p><p>Nook&Stitch FungeeFree™ excels with its powerful motor, adjustable speed, and hygienic self-adhesive sanding pads. I highly recommend this effective, gentle tool for smooth, healthy feet at home.</p>",
